The Arab Center for Earthquake and Natural Disaster Prevention (ACEPNDP) organized an advanced workshop in Algeria on November 11‑12. The event brought together specialists from ten Arab nations, including Syria, and was conducted in partnership with the Global Earthquake Model (GEM) Foundation.

