Jamal Zakkour, head of the Syrian National Earthquake Center, said the training offered significant insights into how Algeria assesses earthquake risk. He noted that the workshop facilitated the sharing of expertise and contemporary methods among the involved countries, enhancing understanding of seismic phenomena and strengthening disaster‑response plans.

